@startuml
title Buffer lifecycle (state machine)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #DDF0DD
skinparam StateBorderColor #37474F
[*] --> Empty : alloc(n, unit)\n<latex>C = n</latex> (bytes) or <latex>C = 4n</latex> (utf8)
Empty --> Filling : writeBytes / writeByte
Filling --> Filling : writeBytes fits\n(<latex>\ell + k \le C</latex>)
Filling --> Full : write reaches <latex>\ell = C</latex>
Full --> Full : writeBytes =>\n[false, BUFERR_CAPACITY_EXCEEDED]
Filling --> Draining : read(n) advances <latex>\rho</latex>
Full --> Draining : read(n)
Draining --> Draining : read(n) while <latex>\rho < \ell</latex>
Empty --> Empty : clear()
Filling --> Empty : clear()
Full --> Empty : clear()
Draining --> Empty : clear()
@enduml
